OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in five-storey block of
OL,4,Aflats fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a fire in a
OL,7,Ffive-storey block of flats in
OL,8,FSouthampton.
OL,10,FFirefighters used two aerial ladder
OL,11,Fplatforms to tackle the blaze in the
OL,12,Fbuilding on Anglesea Terrace after
OL,13,Fpassers-by reported seeing smoke at
OL,14,Fabout 06:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,16,FHampshire Police said a man in his 20s
OL,17,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene. The
OL,18,Fdeath is being treated as unexplained
OL,19,Fand a file is being prepared for the
OL,20,Fcoroner.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
